  "body": "The description of the [`<style>`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-style-element) reads:\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<dl>\r\n<dt>Contexts in which this element can be used:</dt>\r\n<dd><ul>\r\n<li>Where metadata content is expected.</li>\r\n<li>In a noscript element that is a child of a head element.</li>\r\n</ul></dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\nThis list lacks the usage of `<style>` within [`<template>`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#the-template-element) or [`<slot>`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#the-slot-element) elements.",
